      "start": 83.72,
      "end": 93.56,
      "speaker": "Speaker 3",
      "text": "working out. Let's make this the next Red Bull energy drink. Where are we with the advertising"
    },
    {
      "start": 93.56,
      "end": 103.52,
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "text": "and promotion strategy? We still have a few things to work out, but we are planning to have a power"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.52,
      "end": 111.36,
