      "text": "hitter from the Japan Baseball League as a celebrity endorsement. We still have to iron"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.36,
      "end": 122.76,
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "text": "out some details, but we think he's a great fit. Great idea. Well, let's set aside more time"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.8,
      "end": 132.2,
      "speaker": "Speaker 3",
      "text": "at the next meeting for a more in-depth look at what you have planned. Of course, that's really"
    },
    {
      "start": 132.2,
      "end": 142.8,
      "speaker": "Speaker 3",
      "text": "important, but we have a lot to cover in today's meeting. Okay, Tony, I will be ready to present"
    },
    {
      "start": 142.8,
      "end": 151.6,
      "speaker": "Speaker 3",
      "text": "to everyone then. Let's move on to the next topic. I have sent around an action list for"
    },
    {
